The same issue affects the other branches. A large input source or one large forced prime does not make every other support prime large.

#### 2.9 An especially revealing internal tension

Accept the paper’s Corollary 4.3 for the moment:
\[
q\ge11\quad\Longrightarrow\quad\omega(N)\ge27.
\]

Now consider a two-slot envelope with at most \(18\) further support-prime slots. Its intended meaning implies
